# In-browser (WASM) engine
#  - web/mgba-splitscreen-web.{js,wasm}: build outputs, regenerated by web/build.sh.
#    TRACKED in git (GitHub Pages deploys them); rebuild + commit when the
#    engine changes.
#  - src/mgba-splitscreen-web.{js,wasm}: local deploy copies (web/build.sh drops them
#    here for local previews). IGNORED so the desktop (Tauri) bundle, which
#    embeds mgba-splitscreen/src, never ships the web engine.
#  - src/mgba-splitscreen-web-dbg.*: debug builds for core debugging only
src/mgba-splitscreen-web.js
src/mgba-splitscreen-web.wasm
src/mgba-splitscreen-web-dbg.js
src/mgba-splitscreen-web-dbg.wasm

# Local test assets (symlinks into the developer's machine)
src/roms
src/linktest.gba
